Problems/Problem 44\">44</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_45\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 45\">45</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_46\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 46\">46</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_47\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 47\">47</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 48\">48</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_49\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 49\">49</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_50\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 50\">50</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_51\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 51\">51</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_52\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 52\">52</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_53\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 53\">53</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_54\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 54\">54</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_55\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 55\">55</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_56\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 56\">56</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_57\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 57\">57</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_58\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 58\">58</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_59\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 59\">59</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_60\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 60\">60</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"